# ShellCheck config for this repo.
#
# These files are zsh, and ShellCheck has no zsh support - it lints them as if
# they were bash. The checks below are categorically wrong here rather than
# things worth fixing, so they are off repo-wide. Anything still reported is
# a real finding worth reading.

# SC2148: "add a shebang". Every file here is a fragment sourced by index.sh
#         into an already-running zsh. A shebang would be misleading - none of
#         them is ever executed directly.
# SC1090: "can't follow non-constant source". The platform/mode files are
#         resolved at runtime from $OS_ID and $OC_MODE. That is the design.
# SC1091: "not following <file>". Points at things outside the repo entirely -
#         /etc/os-release, ~/.cargo/env, ~/.nvm/nvm.sh, your untracked local.sh.
disable=SC2148,SC1090,SC1091
